  "rule": "The input is a wallpaper over colours 1..n. Row 0 is a minimal tile with horizontal period px. Each later row is the row above with every colour incremented cyclically in 1..n, so the vertical period is n. Non-overlapping solid colour-1 rectangles are pasted over it. The output is the clean wallpaper. Each masked cell takes the colour of its (y mod n, x mod px) class, so masked cells whose true colour is 1 stay 1.",
